    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3001\u5F53\u7136\u3088\u306D\u3002\u3053\u306E\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u304C\u8003\u3048\u305F\u4F5C\u6226\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, naturally. It was my plan after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E00\u9023\u306E\u4E8B\u4EF6\u306E\u89E3\u6C7A\u306B\u5BFE\u3059\u308B\u8CA2\u732E\u306B\u8CDB\u8F9E\u3092\u8D08\u308D\u3046\u3002\n\u3060\u304C\u5143\u3092\u305F\u3069\u308C\u3070\u3001\u81EA\u8EAB\u3067\u8494\u3044\u305F\u7A2E\u3068\u3082\u8A00\u3048\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I commend you for helping resolve this series of incidents. However, you could say you brought this upon yourselves."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u516C\u8A8D\u8A66\u9A13\u3060\u304B\u77E5\u3089\u306A\u3044\u304C\u3001\u3042\u307E\u308A\u6D6E\u304B\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3088\u3046\u3067\u306F\n\u307E\u305F\u4ECA\u56DE\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u4E8B\u4EF6\u3092\u5F15\u304D\u8D77\u3053\u3059\u305E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don\u0027t care if it\u0027s for a certification exam or what\u2014if you get too carried away, you\u0027ll end up causing more incidents like this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u306F\u6C17\u3092\u5F15\u304D\u7DE0\u3081\u3066\u6D3B\u52D5\u3059\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "From now on, try to be more mindful in your activities."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3063\u2026\u2026\u4F55\u3082\u8FD4\u3059\u8A00\u8449\u304C\u306A\u3044\u308F\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... I have nothing to say in response...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u82B8\u4EBA\u306F\u3084\u3081\u3093\u306A\u3088\uFF1F\n\u3042\u306E\u30CD\u30BF\u3001\u606F\u3074\u3063\u305F\u308A\u3067\u3044\u3064\u898B\u3066\u3082\u9762\u767D\u3044\u3093\u3060\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But don\u0027t quit the comedy act, okay? That routine of yours is always hilarious\u2014your timing is perfect!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u3089\u306F\u82B8\u4EBA\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3063\u3066\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I keep telling you we\u0027re not comedians!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u305D\u3046\u3001\u305D\u306E\u30C4\u30C3\u30B3\u30DF\uFF01\n\u3084\u3063\u3071\u3044\u3064\u898B\u3066\u3082\u30AD\u30EC\u30C3\u30AD\u30EC\u3067\u6700\u9AD8\u3060\u306A\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, yeah, that\u0027s the comeback! Your reactions are always spot-on!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30AF\u30C0",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Magda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u304A\u3001\u304A\u524D\u305F\u3061\u3001\u82B8\u4EBA\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Wait, you\u0027re not comedians?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D6\u30E9\u30C3\u30C9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brad"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u82B8\u4EBA\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304F\u3066\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We\u0027re alchemists, not comedians!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306F\u306F\u306F\u2026\u2026\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u677F\u306B\u3064\u304D\u3059\u304E\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F\u306D\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha... Maybe we\u0027ve gotten a bit too good at this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\uFF5E\uFF01\u3000\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306F\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u5929\u624D\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u306A\u306E\u306B\uFF5E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Geez! I really am a genius alchemist~!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]